    <section class="page-header" style="padding: 140px 0 60px;"><div class="bg-gradient-animated"></div><div class="container"><p style="color:#93c5fd; font-size:0.85rem; font-weight:600;">BLOG</p><h1 style="font-size:2.6rem; font-weight:800; color:#fff; margin:0.5rem 0 1rem;">Video Review Pricing in India 2026</h1><p style="font-size:1.15rem; color:#cbd5e1; max-width:700px;">What video review platforms actually cost — and what you get for your money.</p><div class="header-accent"></div></div></section>
