      <p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Video review pricing in India varies widely depending on the platform, verification depth, and deliverables. Here is a practical breakdown of what each platform charges and what you actually receive.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin:2rem 0 1rem;">AnalyzeG — One-Time Dataset Licensing</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">AnalyzeG uses <strong>one-time dataset licensing</strong> with no subscription — final quote after scoping (volume, categories, filters, timeline).</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;"><strong>Includes:</strong> 5-point verified 30s videos, Power BI dashboard + template, sentiment analysis, keyword themes, demographic filters (state/age/gender), competitor benchmarking, raw CSV/Excel with video links (gated access), ad licensing for own-product videos where reviewers opt in. In-stock datasets deliver in minutes; custom collection per agreed SLA. GST invoice. No subscription.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin:2rem 0 1rem;">Bazaarvoice — Custom Enterprise Pricing</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Enterprise contracts with custom pricing. Includes review syndication to major retailers. Requires enterprise onboarding. Pricing is not public — request a demo for a quote.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin:2rem 0 1rem;">Yotpo — Tiered Subscription</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Tiered monthly plans that scale with order volume, reviews, and add-on modules (loyalty, SMS, email). Check their current pricing page — tiers change frequently.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin:2rem 0 1rem;">Reviews.io — Tiered Subscription</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Tiered monthly plans for text, photo, and video reviews with rich snippets and integrations. Check their current pricing page for details.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin:2rem 0 1rem;">The Bottom Line</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">For Indian D2C brands that need verified video intelligence with Power BI dashboards and raw data, compare total scope — not headline price: verification depth, video count, dashboard access, raw export rights, and ad licensing. One-time dataset licensing means no recurring costs.</p>
